  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given coordinates of triangle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Area<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>If&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;is positive&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>If&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>is negative</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Sum of possible values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
